<section class="panel" id="panel-1" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-1" ><header class="part-head"><span class="part-n">Part 01</span><h1>Java Core, JVM &amp; Concurrency</h1><p class="kicker">Language, memory, threads <span class="dot">·</span> 76 questions</p></header><div class="prose">
